	(text "SUP_OPEN high: 2N7002 sinks EN. MCU dead or Hi-Z: pull-up opens the banks. The FET only sinks, so firmware cannot close an open loop.\nCat 1 option: remove the 0R, fit the four DNP parts, 289 ms nominal (232-356 ms). DNP in rev A: Cat 0.\nRe-close latch: loop open, watchdog or power-up clears the flops. Re-arming needs a rising edge from the NO reset button with the loop closed. A held button does nothing. No firmware path.\n10k + 100 nF on CLR rides through contact chatter, about 1.4 ms added to a stop.\nOne series loop still feeds both channels: a short across one contact pair defeats both. Not Cat 3."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 292.1 158 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.5 1.5)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "7796926c-adca-50c0-9875-353223a917b4")
	)
