	(text "Hardware watchdog and port gate. Starts itself at power-up, no firmware can start or stop it:\nSET1 high, CWD open = 1.6 s (1.36-1.84 s). Timeout pulls WD_N low, clears both E-stop latches.\nPORT_OE_N follows latch A, so every PORT_EN tri-states and its 100k pulls it off. Compute rails untouched."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 419.1 185 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.5 1.5)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "279af6d1-3641-5bb7-8dd9-ce4fd77dbd13")
	)
